{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Lead 1 settled before code change: 8h CloudWatch sweep after 2684/5993 deploy showed head metrics gerrit_healthy, reviewbot_healthy, GerritReachable, mcp_healthy, root_disk_used_percent, gate_scratch_mounted, plus probe_ok/probe_elapsed_seconds/probe_truncated all at 85 datapoints with 10.0 minute max inter-arrival; the prior 25 minute head gap narrowed after 2684. Remaining independent publishing defect implemented/tested in worktree alm-a7bd: main probe now falls back to cached region and instance id when IMDS misses, matching the stop hook's cache pattern so successful head health probes do not publish with empty --region/InstanceId."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788817450658079001,"uuid":"c6e89bd5-536a-420b-b092-a3b1b9192cea"}